# 文本统一按 LF 入库/检出，与 .editorconfig、Prettier（endOfLine: lf）一致
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理例外：cmd.exe 解析纯 LF 的 .bat 时，goto/label 可能错位
# （android/gradlew.bat 正是带 label 的批处理，坏掉只表现为"构建莫名失败"）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制图档与字体：禁止任何换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.vsav binary
